+## [v0.1.25-test.1] - 2026-11-25
+
+> R38 — real phone status widgets; receiver and Android build validation pending.
+
+### English
+- Add a two-card glass widget layout with local clock/date, phone battery/charging status and current projection pacing target.
+- Cache battery service reads for five seconds; invalid or unavailable readings remain unknown. Refresh pacing target independently.
+- Separate widget invalidation from media metadata and follow phone time-zone changes.
+
+### 简体中文
+- 新增双卡片玻璃小组件：本地时钟日历、手机真实电量及充电状态、当前投屏调度目标。
+- 电量服务五秒缓存，异常或不可用数据不伪造；投屏目标帧率独立更新。
+- 小组件脏区与媒体元数据分离，跟随手机时区变化。
+
